Fonts bundled in src/lib/assets/fonts/

- inter-latin-variable.woff2: Inter, by Rasmus Andersson and the Inter project authors.
  https://github.com/rsms/inter
- space-grotesk-latin-variable.woff2: Space Grotesk, by Florian Karsten and the Space Grotesk
  project authors. https://github.com/floriankarsten/space-grotesk

Both fonts are licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1:
https://openfontlicense.org/open-font-license-official-text/

The files are Latin-subset variable builds, copied from the Data Observatory sister sites
(Data-Observatory/fairness). They are self-hosted: the site makes no runtime request to a font
CDN. The OFL applies to the font files only; site code is MIT (LICENSE) and data is CC-BY-4.0
(LICENSE-DATA).
